        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1rem;">Ecodesign Compliance</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.7;">GOTS organic cotton, GRS recycled materials, and OEKO-TEX certified production meet EU sustainability requirements and circular economy goals.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;">
        <p style="font-size:0.6rem;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#e00;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Traceability</p>
