      </div>
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1rem;">REACH Compliant</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.7;">Full REACH regulation compliance for chemical substances, with OEKO-TEX certification ensuring no harmful substances in finished garments.</p>
      </div>
