        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What is EU GSP and how does it benefit my imports?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">EU GSP (Generalised Scheme of Preferences) provides duty-free access for Bangladesh garment exports under the Everything But Arms (EBA) arrangement. Most apparel categories enter the EU with zero customs duty across all 27 member states.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What is the EU EPR 2026 requirement for textiles?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">The EU Ecodesign for Sustainable Products Regulation (ESPR) requires Digital Product Passports (DPP) for textiles from 2026. We provide complete product documentation including material composition, environmental impact, and recyclability data for DPP compliance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What documents do I need to import clothing from Bangladesh to the EU?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Required documents include commercial invoice, packing list, bill of lading, certificate of origin, and EU GSP proof of origin (EUR.1 or origin declaration). We also provide REACH compliance certificates and textile labeling documentation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">How long does shipping from Bangladesh to the EU take?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Ocean freight to Rotterdam takes 20-25 days, to Hamburg 22-27 days, to Antwerp 20-25 days. Production adds 30-45 days before shipping. Air freight reduces transit to 5-7 days for urgent orders. Weekly sailings ensure reliable schedules.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Do you comply with REACH regulations for EU imports?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Yes. We maintain OEKO-TEX certification which ensures compliance with REACH chemical regulations. All materials are tested for harmful substances, and we provide REACH compliance documentation with every shipment to the EU.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

